<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <title>Welcome to SnackRapido!</title>
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <style type="text/css">
    /* Base */
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      min-width: 100%;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      background-color: #fafafa;
      color: #222222;
    }

    a {
      color: #0070f3;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Layout */
    .email-wrapper {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .email-header {
      background-color: #0070f3;
      padding: 24px;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .email-body {
      padding: 24px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .email-footer {
      background-color: #f6f6f6;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #0070f3;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="email-header">
      <h1>Welcome to SnackRapido!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="email-body">
      <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>Congratulations! Your restaurant account has been successfully activated.</p>
      <p>You can now start managing your restaurant, adding menu items, and serving customers through our platform.</p>
      <a class="button" href="https://snackrapido.com/restaurant-dashboard">Go to Dashboard</a>
      <p>If you have any questions, our support team is here to help!</p>
    </div>
    <div class="email-footer">
      <p>Thank you for choosing SnackRapido!</p>
      <p>If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact us at <a href="mailto:support@snackrapido.com">support@snackrapido.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>













